{
  "title": "Nourishing Smoky Peruvian Cabbage Skewers",
  "description": "A smoky and flavorful Peruvian dish featuring white cabbage and pickle, perfect for a midnight craving. This recipe is dash-friendly and served on a bamboo tray.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
